78f82.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=240&w=320","width":320,"height":240},"640x480":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1658638/62ab2189-8489-4637-8058-b77bcb778f82.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=480&w=640","width":640,"height":480},"800x600":{"link":"https://housinganywhere.imgix.net/unit_type/1658638/62ab2189-8489-4637-8058-b77bcb778f82.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&cs=srgb&fit=clip&h=600&w=800","width":800,"height":600}}}],"videos":null,"description":"Furnished 2-Room Apartment in Heilbronn’s Most Desirable Location\n\nWelcome to Prompt-House 6, an exclusive residential project at the idyllic Trappensee – one of Heilbronn’s most sought-after addresses. This modern property features just three premium apartments, combining living, working, and lifestyle at the highest level.\n\nThis stylishly furnished 2-room apartment offers the perfect balance of tranquility, nature, and urban convenience – ideal for professionals, project staff, and guests working with IPAI Heilbronn or seeking flexible living options in the region.\n\nLocation & Surroundings\n\nSituated directly by the picturesque Trappensee, surrounded by greenery and recreational areas\n\nExcellent connection to Heilbronn city center and the regional business hub\n\nShort distance to the IPAI Innovation Park for Artificial Intelligence – Europe’s future hotspot for AI development\n\nShopping, dining, and leisure facilities just around the corner\n\nApartment & Features\n\nModern, fully equipped kitchen with high-quality appliances\n\nBright living room with cozy lounge area\n\nQuiet bedroom with comfortable bed and storage space\n\nElegant bathroom with walk-in shower\n\nTasteful, contemporary furnishings – ready to move in and feel at home\n\nWiFi & Smart TV included\n\nThe Project – Where Innovation Meets Comfort\n\nPrompt-House 6 stands for flexible, high-quality living in an environment that combines innovation with quality of life. Within the coming months, th